<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a legal instrument to the OWL-Time interval during which it is in force; the interval has no end while the instrument is not repealed."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relie un instrument juridique à l'intervalle OWL-Time pendant lequel il est en vigueur; l'intervalle n'a pas de fin tant que l'instrument n'est pas abrogé."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000423> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "At most one value per subject; enforced by SHACL (Phase 4), not by an OWL functional axiom, to keep the module in OWL 2 EL."@en .
