<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates two concepts of different vocabularies that share part of their meaning, neither including the other; the annotation states what is shared."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000827> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relie deux concepts de vocabulaires différents qui partagent une partie de leur sens sans que l'un englobe l'autre; l'annotation précise ce qui est partagé."@fr .
