# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "contribue à la conformité à"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supports compliance with"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relates a control or framework requirement to a provision or obligation that implementing it can help meet. It never proves compliance: that needs a compliance determination with evidence."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relie une mesure ou une exigence de référentiel à une disposition ou à une obligation que sa mise en œuvre peut aider à respecter. Elle ne prouve jamais la conformité, qui exige un constat de conformité appuyé de preuves."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 6 (supports is not proves)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000828> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
