# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000830
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000830> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000830> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#relatedMatch> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000830> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "evaluates control"@en .
