# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000017> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000001> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "actif de service"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "service asset"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "SaaS"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "cloud service"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Actif constitué de la capacité d'un fournisseur à offrir un service à l'organisation, à l'interne ou à titre de tiers, comme une application infonuagique, un hébergement, des télécommunications ou un service de sécurité géré; cette capacité réside dans les systèmes ou l'organisation du fournisseur."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An asset that is a provider's capability to deliver a service to the organisation, internally or as a third party, such as a cloud application, hosting, telecommunications or a managed security service; the capability inheres in the provider's systems or organisation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000064> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Realizable entity (capability) rather than process, so a service can be owned, valued and depended on (review H3)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CyberRiskGuardian, scenario-selection-instructions.md, steps 9-12 and required output A-E (commit f0cd36e)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Phase 1 scenario extraction (Drive folder 'scenarios'): corpora A-D, F"@en .
