<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-08"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000007> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.1.0" .
