# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000022
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000022> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000022> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "legal obligation"@en .
