# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000023
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000023> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "risk scenario"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000023> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "scénario de risque"@fr .
