# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000338> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "EPSS observation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "observation EPSS"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An observation of the Exploit Prediction Scoring System score of a published vulnerability on a given day: FIRST's estimated probability that the vulnerability is exploited in the wild in the following 30 days, with its percentile among all scored vulnerabilities. It concerns the vulnerability in general, not its presence in any organisation, and it is not the likelihood of a risk scenario."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Observation du score de l'Exploit Prediction Scoring System d'une vulnérabilité publiée un jour donné : la probabilité, estimée par FIRST, que la vulnérabilité soit exploitée dans les 30 jours suivants, avec son centile parmi toutes les vulnérabilités évaluées. Elle porte sur la vulnérabilité en général, non sur sa présence dans une organisation, et ce n'est pas la vraisemblance d'un scénario de risque."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Replaces the 0.8.0 EPSS likelihood estimates (decision D4); specification section 5 (do not conflate probability of exploitation with scenario likelihood)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "FIRST, Exploit Prediction Scoring System: model documentation and data (first.org/epss)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000340> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000009> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "activité de traitement"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "processing activity"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "traitement de données"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A business process, or part of one, in which an organisation collects, uses, discloses, keeps or destroys personal information for stated purposes."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Processus d'affaires, ou partie de processus, dans lequel une organisation recueille, utilise, communique, conserve ou détruit des renseignements personnels à des fins déterminées."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GDPR Art. 30 record entries; Loi 25 purposes of collection. Needed to evaluate applicability (specification section 9)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CQLR c. P-39.1 ss. 1, 3.1-3.8, 17, 18.3; CQLR c. A-2.1 s. 3; CQLR c. R-22.1 s. 4 (LégisQuébec, updated to 2026-08-12)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Arts. 3, 4, 24, 28, 30 (OJ L 119, 4.5.2016)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000341> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/BFO_0000023> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rôle de fournisseur"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "supplier role"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "third party"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "tiers"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A role of an organisation that supplies goods, services or the operation of assets to another organisation, which comes to depend on it."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Rôle d'une organisation qui fournit des biens, des services ou l'exploitation d'actifs à une autre organisation, laquelle en vient à en dépendre."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Anti-rigid (OntoClean): an organisation is a supplier only relative to a customer, so modelled as a BFO role borne by the organisation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000342> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "instrument juridique"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "legal instrument"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A statute, regulation or regulatory guideline taken as a whole, identified by its official citation, with its jurisdiction and the dates of its publication, coming into force, application and consolidation. Its provisions are the concepts of the corresponding CRGO vocabulary."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Loi, règlement ou ligne directrice réglementaire pris dans son ensemble, identifié par sa citation officielle, avec sa juridiction et les dates de sa publication, de son entrée en vigueur, de sa prise d'effet et de sa mise à jour. Ses dispositions sont les concepts du vocabulaire CRGO correspondant."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Specification section 5 (separate instrument, provision, obligation, applicability, determination)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CQLR c. P-39.1 ss. 1, 3.1-3.8, 17, 18.3; CQLR c. A-2.1 s. 3; CQLR c. R-22.1 s. 4 (LégisQuébec, updated to 2026-08-12)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Arts. 3, 4, 24, 28, 30 (OJ L 119, 4.5.2016)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000343> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 5 (all terms, including the GRCA additions)"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicability condition"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "condition d'applicabilité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A description of a condition under which a legal instrument or one of its provisions applies to an organisation, such as its territory, organisation type, sector, role in processing personal information or a threshold, written as a CRGO paraphrase with its citation and a machine-readable test."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description d'une condition à laquelle un instrument juridique ou l'une de ses dispositions s'applique à une organisation, comme son territoire, son type d'organisation, son secteur, son rôle dans le traitement de renseignements personnels ou un seuil, rédigée comme une paraphrase de CRGO avec sa citation et un test lisible par machine."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Conditions are evaluated over an organisation profile, never asserted as class membership (specification section 9)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CQLR c. P-39.1 ss. 1, 3.1-3.8, 17, 18.3; CQLR c. A-2.1 s. 3; CQLR c. R-22.1 s. 4 (LégisQuébec, updated to 2026-08-12)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "OSFI Guideline B-13, scope (federally regulated financial institutions), 2022-07-31"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "PIPEDA ss. 4, 26(2)(b), Sch. 1 (S.C. 2000, c. 5, current to 2026-09-21)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "Regulation (EU) 2016/679, Arts. 3, 4, 24, 28, 30 (OJ L 119, 4.5.2016)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000344> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 5 (all terms, including the GRCA additions)"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "applicability assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "évaluation de l'applicabilité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record (not the act of assessing) of whether a legal instrument or provision applies to a given organisation, giving the state reached (applicable, not applicable, potentially applicable or unknown) and the conditions found met, not met or undetermined."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté indiquant si un instrument juridique ou une disposition s'applique à une organisation donnée, avec l'état retenu (applicable, non applicable, potentiellement applicable ou inconnu) et les conditions jugées remplies, non remplies ou indéterminées."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Specification section 9 states; 'unknown' when a needed fact is absent, so missing data never yields 'not applicable'."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000345> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 5 (all terms, including the GRCA additions)"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000511> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "compliance determination"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constat de conformité"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "compliance assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record, made by an identified assessor, of the extent to which a given organisation satisfies a legal provision or obligation, with the evidence relied on or an explicit statement of the missing evidence. A mapped control or framework requirement is not by itself evidence of compliance."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté, établi par un évaluateur identifié, du degré auquel une organisation donnée satisfait à une disposition ou à une obligation légale, avec les preuves retenues ou un énoncé explicite des preuves manquantes. Un contrôle ou une exigence de référentiel mis en correspondance ne constitue pas à lui seul une preuve de conformité."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "Specification sections 9 and 13 (state, assessor, date, evidence or evidence gap)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO v0.8 to v1.0 Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, 2026-10-11), sections 3-13"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000346> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
