<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 5 (all terms, including the GRCA additions)"@en .
