<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000475> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 10 (observed versus hypothesised cause); GAPS D08. Distinct from assumption: an assumption is taken as true for an estimate, a hypothesis is put forward to be tested."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000475> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
