# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "independence assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "évaluation de l'indépendance"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record of whether an assessor or assurance function is independent and objective with respect to the activity it assesses, with the threats to independence considered."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté indiquant si un évaluateur ou une fonction d'assurance est indépendant et objectif à l'égard de l'activité qu'il évalue, avec les menaces à l'indépendance examinées."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000496> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GIAS Principles 2 (Maintain Objectivity) and 7 (Positioned Independently); ITAF 1002 and 1003."@en .
