# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "policy"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "politique"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A directive approved by an organisation's governing body or senior management that states its intentions and rules for a domain, such as information security or privacy."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Directive approuvée par l'organe de gouvernance ou la haute direction d'une organisation qui énonce ses intentions et ses règles pour un domaine, comme la sécurité de l'information ou la protection des renseignements personnels."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000497> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
