# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "norme technique interne"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "technical standard"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An internal directive that specifies mandatory technical requirements implementing one or more policy statements, such as a password or encryption standard."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Directive interne précisant les exigences techniques obligatoires qui mettent en œuvre un ou plusieurs énoncés de politique, comme une norme de mots de passe ou de chiffrement."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D01. Not an external standard such as ISO/IEC 27002, which is a framework."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000499> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
