<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000974> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "procedure"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "procédure"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plan that sets out the steps by which a policy statement or technical standard is carried out, by whom and when."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Plan qui expose les étapes par lesquelles un énoncé de politique ou une norme technique est appliqué, par qui et quand."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000500> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
