# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "configuration baseline"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "configuration de référence"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "baseline"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An approved set of configuration settings that a kind of system must meet, against which deviations are detected."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Ensemble approuvé de paramètres de configuration auquel un type de système doit se conformer et par rapport auquel les écarts sont détectés."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000501> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D01 (baseline)."@en .
