# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "dérogation"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "policy exception"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "exemption"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "waiver"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A directive that permits a stated deviation from a policy statement, technical standard or control for a stated scope (role, asset or process) and period, approved by an identified authority and usually with compensating controls. It does not waive a legal obligation."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Directive qui autorise un écart déterminé par rapport à un énoncé de politique, une norme technique ou une mesure, pour une portée (rôle, actif ou processus) et une période données, approuvée par une autorité identifiée et généralement assortie de mesures compensatoires. Elle ne dispense d'aucune obligation légale."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D01; GRCA section 6 (waiver or exception). Distinct from risk acceptance, which retains a risk rather than permitting a deviation from a rule."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000502> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 1"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000020> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "compensating control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mesure compensatoire"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A control measure put in place because a required control is not, or not fully, implemented, intended to reduce the same risk to a comparable degree."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mesure appliquée mise en place parce qu'une mesure exigée n'est pas, ou pas entièrement, mise en œuvre, et destinée à réduire le même risque dans une mesure comparable."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D01."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000503> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 1"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "decision record"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "relevé de décision"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record of a decision taken by an identified agent on a stated subject, such as approving a policy, an exception, a risk acceptance or the closure of a finding, with its outcome and rationale."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté d'une décision prise par un agent identifié sur un objet donné, comme l'approbation d'une politique, d'une dérogation, d'une acceptation du risque ou de la clôture d'une constatation, avec son résultat et sa justification."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D07 (approval record, rejection, deferral, rationale)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 1"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000504> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "exception expiry review"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "revue d'échéance de dérogation"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A decision record made when a policy exception reaches its expiry date, deciding whether it is renewed, changed or ended."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000505> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Relevé de décision établi lorsqu'une dérogation arrive à échéance, décidant si elle est renouvelée, modifiée ou close."@fr .
