<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000510> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A record that an event, such as a regulatory change, an incident, an audit finding or the expiry of an exception, requires an existing assessment or determination to be reviewed."@en .
