# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000036> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "external assurance report"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rapport d'assurance externe"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An evidence item describing a report issued by an independent assurer on an organisation's or a service provider's controls, such as a SOC 1 or SOC 2 report or a certification audit report, with its type, period, scope, opinion, exceptions and the controls it expects users to operate."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Élément de preuve décrivant un rapport émis par un assureur indépendant sur les mesures d'une organisation ou d'un fournisseur de services, comme un rapport SOC 1 ou SOC 2 ou un rapport d'audit de certification, avec son type, sa période, son périmètre, son opinion, ses exceptions et les mesures qu'il attend des utilisateurs."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 9 (SOC report scope, period, exceptions, CUECs)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "AICPA 2017 Trust Services Criteria for Security, Availability, Processing Integrity, Confidentiality, and Privacy (revised points of focus, 2022); identifiers cited"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000522> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 2"@en .
