# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "assurance report exception"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "exception de rapport d'assurance"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A deviation reported in an external assurance report, where a tested control did not operate as described during the period."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Écart signalé dans un rapport d'assurance externe, lorsqu'une mesure testée n'a pas fonctionné comme décrit pendant la période."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000523> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
