# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "complementary user entity control"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "mesure complémentaire de l'entité utilisatrice"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "CUEC"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A control that an external assurance report assumes the user organisation operates, without which the service provider's controls may not achieve their objectives."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Mesure que le rapport d'assurance externe suppose exploitée par l'organisation utilisatrice, sans laquelle les mesures du fournisseur de services pourraient ne pas atteindre leurs objectifs."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 9."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000524> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 2"@en .
