# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "evidence sufficiency assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "évaluation du caractère suffisant des preuves"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record of an assessor's judgement of whether the evidence gathered is sufficient, relevant, current and in scope for a stated objective or criterion."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté du jugement d'un évaluateur sur le caractère suffisant, pertinent, actuel et conforme au périmètre des preuves recueillies pour un objectif ou un critère donné."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 9 (explicit sufficiency assessment); ITAF 1205; GIAS Standard 14.1."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000525> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
