# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000347> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "operating effectiveness assessment"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "évaluation de l'efficacité opérationnelle"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A control assessment that tests whether a control measure operated as designed throughout a stated period, over a stated population or sample."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Évaluation de mesure qui vérifie si une mesure appliquée a fonctionné comme prévu pendant toute une période donnée, sur une population ou un échantillon donné."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D05 (operating effectiveness over a period and population)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000526> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 2"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "control deficiency"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "déficience de contrôle"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A record that the design, implementation or operation of an existing control measure does not allow it to meet its objective, identified by a control assessment, with its severity. Unlike a control gap, which describes an expected control that is absent or inadequate (often in a risk scenario), a deficiency is an assessed result about a measure in place."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement indiquant que la conception, la mise en œuvre ou le fonctionnement d'une mesure appliquée existante ne lui permet pas d'atteindre son objectif, relevé par une évaluation de mesure, avec sa gravité. Contrairement à un écart de contrôle, qui décrit un contrôle attendu absent ou insuffisant (souvent dans un scénario de risque), une déficience est un résultat d'évaluation portant sur une mesure en place."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D05 (deficiency). Distinguished from the 0.1.0 control gap in the definition (independent review, 2026-10-11)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000527> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 2"@en .
