# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "population"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "population"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A description of the complete set of items, such as transactions, accounts or events over a period, from which a sample is drawn or over which a control is tested."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Description de l'ensemble complet des éléments, comme des transactions, des comptes ou des événements sur une période, dans lequel un échantillon est prélevé ou sur lequel une mesure est testée."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000528> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
