# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000974> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "plan d'échantillonnage"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "sampling plan"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A plan that states how items are selected from a population, how many, and the tolerable and expected deviation on which the sample size is based."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Plan qui précise comment les éléments sont choisis dans une population, combien, et les taux d'écart tolérable et attendu sur lesquels repose la taille de l'échantillon."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "ITAF 2208; ISO/IEC TS 27008:2019 clause 7.5 (sampling techniques)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "ISACA IT Audit Framework (ITAF), 5th edition (copyright 2026 ISACA); identifiers and titles cited, text not reproduced"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "ISO/IEC TS 27008:2019, Guidelines for the assessment of information security controls (1st edition, 2019-01); clause identifiers cited"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000529> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
