# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000965> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "audit criterion"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "critère d'audit"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A requirement used as the reference against which the condition found is compared, such as a provision, a control objective, a policy statement or an assessment objective."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Exigence servant de référence à laquelle la situation constatée est comparée, comme une disposition, un objectif de mesure, un énoncé de politique ou un objectif d'évaluation."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000538> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GIAS Standard 13.4 (Evaluation Criteria); ITAF 1008 (Criteria)."@en .
