# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "exception de surveillance"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "monitoring exception"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A record that continuous monitoring, such as a key risk indicator or automated control check, flagged a deviation. It is not an audit finding; it becomes the basis of one only if an audit engagement evaluates it against criteria."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement indiquant qu'une surveillance continue, comme un indicateur clé de risque ou une vérification automatisée, a signalé un écart. Ce n'est pas une constatation d'audit; il n'en devient le fondement que si une mission d'audit l'évalue au regard de critères."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GRCA section 10 (monitoring exception differs from audit finding)."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Governance, Risk, Compliance and Assurance (GRCA) Audit: Claude Implementation Specification (project owner, v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000288> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000181> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000289> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000182> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000290> "2026-10-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000291> "0.9.0" .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000540> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000292> "GRCA review item 3"@en .
# 
# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "audit finding"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "constatation d'audit"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#altLabel> "audit observation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A record, made in an audit engagement, of the difference between a criterion and the condition found, with its observed or hypothesised cause, its effect, its significance and the evidence relied on."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement, établi dans une mission d'audit, de l'écart entre un critère et la situation constatée, avec sa cause observée ou présumée, son effet, son importance et les preuves retenues."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000541> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GIAS Standards 14.2-14.3; ISO 19011:2018 clause 6.4."@en .
