# https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://www.commoncoreontologies.org/ont00000853> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "confirmation d'incident"@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "incident confirmation"@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A dated record, made by an identified agent, that an incident has occurred, citing the alerts or events it is based on."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Enregistrement daté, établi par un agent identifié, indiquant qu'un incident s'est produit, en citant les alertes ou événements sur lesquels il s'appuie."@fr .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000283> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000069> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000284> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000063> .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000285> "GAPS D06 (confirmed incident versus event). Modelled as a record because being confirmed is a status, not a kind of incident."@en .
<https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000552> <https://w3id.org/crgo/CRGO_0000286> "CRGO Knowledge Expansion: Remaining GRC, Cybersecurity and Operational Knowledge Domains (project owner, draft v1.0, 2026-10-11)"@en .
